{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-concepts","title":"CI/CD 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/ci-cd-concepts","wordCount":1408,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-核心概念\">CI/CD 核心概念</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>持续集成（CI）和持续交付/部署（CD）是现代软件工程的基石实践。CI 强调开发者频繁将代码合并到主干分支，每次合并触发自动化构建与测试；CD 则将通过验证的代码自动推送到预发布或生产环境。这一实践从根本上改变了软件交付的节奏——从季度发布到每日甚至每小时发布。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[构建]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单元测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D[集成测试]&#10;    D --&gt; E{质量门禁}&#10;    E --&gt;|通过| F[制品归档]&#10;    E --&gt;|失败| G[通知开发者]&#10;    F --&gt; H[部署到 Staging]&#10;    H --&gt; I[验收测试]&#10;    I --&gt; J[部署到 Production]&#10;    subgraph 持续集成&#10;        A&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 持续交付&#10;        F&#10;        H&#10;        I&#10;        J&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[构建]\n    B --&gt; C[单元测试]\n    C --&gt; D[集成测试]\n    D --&gt; E{质量门禁}\n    E --&gt;|通过| F[制品归档]\n    E --&gt;|失败| G[通知开发者]\n    F --&gt; H[部署到 Staging]\n    H --&gt; I[验收测试]\n    I --&gt; J[部署到 Production]\n    subgraph 持续集成\n        A\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end\n    subgraph 持续交付\n        F\n        H\n        I\n        J\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>持续集成 CI</th>\n<th>持续交付 CD</th>\n<th>持续部署 CD</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>快速发现集成问题</td>\n<td>随时可发布</td>\n<td>自动发布到生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工介入</td>\n<td>无（自动触发）</td>\n<td>发布前需审批</td>\n<td>完全自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发频率</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>每次 CI 通过后</td>\n<td>每次 CI 通过后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险等级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（需完善的测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用阶段</td>\n<td>所有团队</td>\n<td>成熟团队</td>\n<td>高成熟度团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚机制</td>\n<td>代码回滚</td>\n<td>版本回滚</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持续集成的核心原则\">持续集成的核心原则</h2><p>持续集成不仅仅是一个工具或流程，它是一种开发文化。Martin Fowler 定义的 CI 实践包含几个关键原则：<strong>单一代码仓库</strong>、<strong>自动化构建</strong>、<strong>自测构建</strong>、<strong>每日提交</strong>和<strong>快速反馈</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>主干开发（Trunk-Based Development）</strong> 是 CI 的理想分支策略。开发者在短生命周期的特性分支上工作，通常不超过一天就合并回主干。这与长生命周期的 GitFlow 模式形成对比——后者容易导致合并冲突和集成延迟。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CIConfig {&#10;  trigger: TriggerRule;&#10;  stages: Stage[];&#10;  failFast: boolean;&#10;  timeout: number;&#10;  notifications: NotificationChannel[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TriggerRule {&#10;  branches: string[];&#10;  paths: string[];&#10;  events: (&#39;push&#39; | &#39;pull_request&#39; | &#39;schedule&#39;)[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Stage {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  jobs: Job[];&#10;  dependsOn?: string[];&#10;  condition?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Job {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  runner: string;&#10;  steps: Step[];&#10;  timeout: number;&#10;  retries: number;&#10;  cache?: CacheConfig;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CIConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TriggerRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  failFast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  notifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TriggerRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  branches</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'push'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pull_request'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'schedule'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Job</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dependsOn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Job</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  runner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>构建速度是 CI 成功的关键指标。业界公认的标准是 <strong>10 分钟规则</strong>——从提交到获得反馈不应超过 10 分钟。超过这个时间，开发者会切换上下文，反馈循环的价值急剧下降。</p>\n<p>为达到这个目标，常用的加速策略包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>增量构建</strong>：只重新编译变更的模块，利用构建缓存避免重复工作</li>\n<li><strong>并行化</strong>：将独立的测试套件分配到多个运行器上同时执行</li>\n<li><strong>分层测试</strong>：先运行快速的单元测试，通过后再运行慢速的集成测试</li>\n<li><strong>依赖缓存</strong>：缓存 <code>node_modules</code>、Docker 层等不常变化的依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"持续交付-vs-持续部署\">持续交付 vs 持续部署</h2><p>持续交付（Continuous Delivery）和持续部署（Continuous Deployment）虽然缩写相同，但理念有本质区别。</p>\n<p><strong>持续交付</strong>确保代码始终处于可发布状态。流水线会自动将代码推送到预发布环境并完成全部验证，但最终的生产发布由人工触发。这给了团队一个&quot;安全阀&quot;——可以选择合适的时机发布，比如避开业务高峰期。</p>\n<p><strong>持续部署</strong>则完全消除人工环节。每次通过所有自动化验证的代码变更都会自动部署到生产环境。这要求极高的测试覆盖率和监控能力，因为没有人工兜底。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代码变更] --&gt; B[CI 流水线]&#10;    B --&gt; C{所有检查通过?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[阻断并通知]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E{交付模式}&#10;    E --&gt;|持续交付| F[部署到 Staging]&#10;    F --&gt; G[人工审批]&#10;    G --&gt; H[部署到 Production]&#10;    E --&gt;|持续部署| I[自动部署到 Production]&#10;    I --&gt; J[自动化监控]&#10;    J --&gt;|异常| K[自动回滚]\">graph TD\n    A[代码变更] --&gt; B[CI 流水线]\n    B --&gt; C{所有检查通过?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[阻断并通知]\n    C --&gt;|是| E{交付模式}\n    E --&gt;|持续交付| F[部署到 Staging]\n    F --&gt; G[人工审批]\n    G --&gt; H[部署到 Production]\n    E --&gt;|持续部署| I[自动部署到 Production]\n    I --&gt; J[自动化监控]\n    J --&gt;|异常| K[自动回滚]</pre><p>选择哪种模式取决于业务场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>B2C 互联网产品</strong>：持续部署更合适，快速迭代、A/B 测试驱动</li>\n<li><strong>金融/医疗系统</strong>：持续交付更安全，合规要求需要审批记录</li>\n<li><strong>开源项目</strong>：持续交付，版本发布需要变更日志和语义化版本</li>\n<li><strong>内部工具</strong>：持续部署，用户群体固定，风险可控</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"流水线的关键指标\">流水线的关键指标</h2><p>衡量 CI/CD 效果需要关注四个核心指标，这也是 DORA（DevOps Research and Assessment）团队提出的 <strong>四个关键指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>精英团队</th>\n<th>高效团队</th>\n<th>中等团队</th>\n<th>低效团队</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署频率</td>\n<td>按需（每天多次）</td>\n<td>每周到每月</td>\n<td>每月到每季</td>\n<td>每季到每年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更前置时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 小时</td>\n<td>1 天-1 周</td>\n<td>1 周-1 月</td>\n<td>1-6 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更失败率</td>\n<td>0-15%</td>\n<td>16-30%</td>\n<td>16-30%</td>\n<td>&gt; 46%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 小时</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 天</td>\n<td>1 天-1 周</td>\n<td>&gt; 6 个月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PipelineMetrics {&#10;  deployFrequency: number;&#10;  leadTimeForChanges: number;&#10;  changeFailureRate: number;&#10;  timeToRestore: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const calculateDeployFrequency = (deploys: Deployment[], periodDays: number): number =&gt; {&#10;  const successfulDeploys = deploys.filter((d) =&gt; d.status === &#39;success&#39;);&#10;  return successfulDeploys.length / periodDays;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const calculateLeadTime = (commits: CommitWithDeploy[]): number =&gt; {&#10;  const leadTimes = commits.map((c) =&gt; c.deployedAt.getTime() - c.committedAt.getTime());&#10;  return leadTimes.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0) / leadTimes.length;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const calculateChangeFailureRate = (deploys: Deployment[]): number =&gt; {&#10;  const failed = deploys.filter((d) =&gt; d.causedIncident);&#10;  return failed.length / deploys.length;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PipelineMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  deployFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  leadTimeForChanges</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  changeFailureRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timeToRestore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDeployFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">deploys</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Deployment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">periodDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"colo